1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,670
Empezamos en Norteamérica,

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:02,530
en México:

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:05,190
los esquites, salados y cremosos,

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,690
granos de maíz en vasito con mayonesa,

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,430
queso, chile y limón.

6
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,410
Cruzamos el Atlántico hasta Italia:

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:12,810
el pecorino sardo,

8
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:15,070
un queso salado de oveja de Cerdeña que

9
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,690
se come con un hilo de miel.

10
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,350
Viajamos al sur de Asia,

11
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,190
a la India:

12
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,650
el masala dosa,

13
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,850
salado y crocante,

14
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,150
una crep de arroz y lentejas rellena de

15
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:26,210
papa especiada, con chutney de coco.

16
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:28,070
Seguimos al este de Asia,

17
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:28,930
a Japón:

18
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,250
el ajitsuke tamago,

19
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,970
un huevo marinado en soja,

20
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:33,750
salado con un toque dulce,

21
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,630
ideal sobre un plato de ramen.

22
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,750
Cruzamos el Pacífico hasta Perú:

23
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:39,090
el seco de cabrito,

24
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,550
salado y aromático,

25
00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,670
un guiso de cabrito con cilantro que llega

26
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,090
con frijoles y arroz.

27
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,690
Y terminamos en Argentina:

28
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:47,470
la milanesa napolitana,

29
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,670
salada y gratinada,

30
00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:50,190
con salsa de tomate,

31
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,090
jamón y queso,

32
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,730
y papas fritas al lado.

